    "text": "H1essentialOperation Manual\n\nTurning the power off\n\nSlide\n〔此处图示未读取〕\ntoward\n〔此处图示未读取〕\nuntil “Please wait. Saving data…” appears on the display.\n\nThe display will darken and the power will turn off.\n\nNOTE\n\nWhile “Please wait. Saving data…” is shown, the current settings of the H1essential are being saved. While “Please wait. Saving data…” is shown, do not disconnect the AC adapter or remove the batteries.\n\nThe power cannot be turned off while recording. Turn the power off after recording stops.",
